Third-party code and data
-------------------------

Code or data adapted from other open-source projects is listed here, with its
licence and the files it appears in.

- internal/agents/rules/*.toml: screen-rule patterns adapted from Herdr's agent
  detection manifests (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr, src/detect/manifests),
  Copyright the Herdr authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The rule format and engine are our own; the patterns were simplified.

- vt/src/snapshot.zig: the approach to serialising terminal state is adapted
  from zmx's serializeTerminalState (https://github.com/neurosnap/zmx,
  src/util.zig), Copyright (c) 2025 Eric Bower, licensed under the MIT License.
  The full notice is in the file's header.
- vt/: links libghostty-vt from Ghostty (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty),
  Copyright Mitchell Hashimoto and contributors, licensed under the MIT License.

